<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Lughuru Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Pauli kwe iwanu wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Pauli kwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iwanu wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Wakolinto tsayandikikighwa na mtumighwa Pauli mne ghumwaka ghwa hamsini na tano kulawa Yesu helekighwe (1:1). Aino tsaikala ibaluwa ya mwanduso mna tsibaluwa mbili tsandikighwe na Pauli kwa kanisa lya Kolinto. Tsakandika ibaluwa ino hang'ali yokala Efeso ahala ng'ana yalamle ukwangila Kolinto hang'ali yoghenda na ukuya kulawa Makedoniya (16:5-9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mne ibaluwa ino Pauli kakwidika mbuli itsighalighwe ne iwanu kuna yeye, itsilonga ghehile ighatendighwe mne kanisa lya Kolinto, ghehile agho hamwe ne ukwibaghula na ughoni. Ghumji ghwa Kolinto tsaghumanyika ghendo kwa ughoni, apfo ng'achiwile chinu cha kukangawatsa bae Pauli kulyandikila likanisa alyo pfinu apfo. Pfipfila ibaluwa ino ya mwanduso kwa iwanu wa Kolinto, isula ya 13 ina mbuli tsa unoghelo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-9, Pauli kowalamsa Wakorinto na kumlongela Imulungu mighede kwaajili yawo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:10-4-21, kolonga mbuli tsa ukwibaghula mne likanisa lye iwanu wa Korinto.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 5-6, kolonga mbuli tsa ughoni na ukwighala mne libalatsa wawo kwa wawo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 7-15, Pauli kolonga mbuli tsa ukukwela, kulapfa nambiko kwe pfinyagho, na ukutsilihuka.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 16, Pauli komalitsila kwa ukulonga mbuli tsake na sang'ano tsake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Nene Pauli yanikemighwe niwe mtumighwa wa Kiristu Yesu ka Imulungu pfayabamile, na ndughu yetu Sostene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Twomwandikilani mwemwe kanisa ilili mne ghumji ghwa Kolinto, mwemwe imkemighwe muwe iwanu wake wahenzeluka kwa ukwilunga na Yesu Kiristu, hamwe na wala wose iwali chila hanu iwomlomba Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Imulungu Aba wetu na Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu wawatendeleni uluso na yamwikeni tseghamba.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mighede kwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu ghamatsuwa ghose kwa uluso iyawatendele mwemwe kubitila Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Mana kwa ukwilunga ne Kiristu, mwemwe mbweda kwa chila chinu, mbweda mne ukulonga na mne ukumanya. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Usenga wa Kiristu wima pfinoghile mghati mwenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Apfo ng'amuhungukighwe bae na ghweko lyolyose kulawa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, ka pfomumbeta Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu yaghubulighwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Naye katsowakindilisa, katsoweng'a ingupfu mbaka utsighilo, ili mkale mwahela litotso mne litsuwa lye Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Imulungu iyotogholighwa, kamkemani muwe sale wa Mwanaghe Yesu Kiristu, Imtwatsa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubaghutsi kwe iwanu iwomtoghola Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Ndughu tsangu, nowalomba kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu mwilaghane kwa chila chinu chomlonga ili mleke kwibaghula mwemwe kwa mwemwe. Ghendoghendo mwalangule chinu chimwe na mlonge chicho. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ndughu tsangu, iwanu wangi kulawa ing'anda ya Kiloe wanongela ka mwemwe mwisonga. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Nobama nilonge chanihulike kuna mwemwe, munu yumwe kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Pauli,” na munu yungi kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Apolo,” na yungi kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Kefa” na yungi “Nene nomuwinza Kiristu.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Angu Kiristu keghola? Angu Pauli tsakawambighwa mna msalaba kwaajili yako? Angu tsambatisighwa mughwe wanang'ina wa Pauli?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Mighede Imulungu kwaapfila simbatitse imunu wowose bae ila Kirispo na Gayo waliheka. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Apfo imunu wowose aleke kulonga ka mwemwe mbatisighwa muwe wanang'ina wangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Nikumbuka, pfipfila tsanimbatisa Stefana na iwanu iwali mng'anda mwake, kuya imane ka nimbatisa imunu yungi. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kwaapfila Kiristu ng'anitumile bae kubatitsa, ila kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile, na si kwa mbuli tsa kuwanogheletsa iwanu, ili lifwa lye Kiristu mna msalaba lileke kwoneka si chinu bae.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristu iyo nzewele ne ingupfu ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kwaapfila usenga wa lifwa lya Yesu mne msalaba wakoneka ubotsi kwe iwanu iwakwagha, lekeni twetwe itukombolighwa twowona ngupfu ye Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Nitsotsihinya nzewele tse wanu wane nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na tsimbutsi tse iwanu wane chisomo nitsotsasa kutali.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Walikwani wanu wane nzewele? Walikwani walangulitsi wa ghamalaghitso? Walikwani wane tsimbutsi sideke? Imulungu kalangusa ghendo ka nzewele ye iwanu we isi ina ubotsi.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Kwa nzewele ye Imulungu, ng'aidahika bae iwanu kummanya yeye kwa nzewele tsawo wenyegho, Imulungu tsakanoghelighwa kuwakombola iwanu iwotoghola kubitila usenga watuwapetela, aula iukoneka ubotsi kwa awala wane nzewele. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Wayahudi wobama kwona pfinzonza, Wagiriki wobama nzewele. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Lekeni twetwe, twowapetela imbuli ye Kiristu iyawambighwe mna msalaba, imbuli iikoneka ng'walo kwa Wayahudi na ubotsi kwe Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Lekeni kwa awala iwakemighwe ne Imulungu, wose Wayahudi na Wagiriki, Kiristu iyo ngupfu ye Imulungu na nzewele ye Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kwaapfila achila ichikoneka ubotsi we Imulungu, china nzewele kubita nzewele ye imunu, na achila ichikoneka chahela ngupfu kwa Imulungu china ngupfu kubita ngupfu ye imunu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Ndughu tsangu, lelo mkumbuke hamkemighwe ne Imulungu, wengi mna mwemwe tsamkala mwahela nzewele ya chimunu, na si wengi bae imkalile ne ngupfu na si wengi bae imkalile ne ubala. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Lekeni Imulungu kasaghula pfinu ipfikoneka pfa ubotsi ipfili muisi kuwaghuma chinyala iwanu wane nzewele, Imulungu kasaghula ipfinu ipfilihela ngupfu, kuwaghuma chinyala awala wane ngupfu. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Imulungu kasaghula aghala ghawabetsile iwanu na aghala ighoneke si chinu bae, ili kughahinya aghala ghawonile iwanu chinu chikulu. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Imulungu katenda apfi ili imunu wowose aleke kwighoda hambele he Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Imulungu iyo iyawatendike mwemwe mwilunge na Yesu Kiristu, iyawile nzewele yetu kulawa kwe Imulungu, twakoneka tunogha hambele he Imulungu, twenzeluka na tukombolighwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Apfo ka pfayandikighwe, “Iyobama kwighoda, yeghodele chayatendile Imtwatsa.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Kiristu iyawambighwe mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ndughu tsangu, hanitsile kuna mwemwe siwapeteleni bae ukweli we usenga we Imulungu kwa kulangusa ka nene nomanya ng'ani au kwa nzewele tse iwanu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Mana hanikalile na mwemwe sibamile bae kumanya chinu chingi ila kummanya Yesu Kiristu yaliyeka, ayula iyawambighwe mna msalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Hanitsile kuna mwemwe, tsanahela ngupfu, tsanidedema ghendo kwa kupfuka. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Usenga wangu na kupeta kwangu ng'akukalile bae kwa malonga gha nzewele ghane kukwegha iwanu, ila tsaghana ingupfu ye Ghumuhe we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Tsanenda apfi ili ukutoghola kwenu kuleke kukala mne hekima tse iwanu, ila ikale mne ngupfu ye Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inzewele ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Twopeta usenga we hekima kwa awala iwakomale mne ukutoghola, lekeni si ihekima ye muisi amu bae, wala si ihekima ye iwakulu we muisi amu iwakwaghitsa ngupfu. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Nowapetela nzewele ye Imulungu iipfisighwe, iyaisaghule kwaajili ye ukwingila mne utunitso wake hata ng'ana isi yose ilumbighwe. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Kuduhu iwakulu we isi yose iwamanyile nzewele ino. Wang'aimanyile wang'alekile kumuwamba mna msalaba Imtwatsa we utunitso. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Lekeni ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Aghala ing'aghoneke wala kuhulikighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">aghala ng'ana ghakwalangulighwe mmoyo mwe imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">igho ghagho Imulungu ghawekile awala iwomnoghela.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Lekeni Imulungu katughubulila chinu acho kubitila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. Kwaapfila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kosakula chila chinu hata ipfinu ipfili mghati mwe Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Yuhi iyodaha kumanya aghala ighali mghati mwe imunu ka si muhe iuli mghati mwake mwenyegho? Pfipfila kuduhu iyomanya ipfinu pfe Imulungu ila Ghumuhe we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Ng'atubokele bae muhe we iisi, ila tubokela Ghumuhe iyatumighwe ne Imulungu ili tumanye aghala ghose ghatwing'ighwe hela ne Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Apfo ng'atulonga bae kwe tsimbutsi itsilangulitsighwe ne nzewele tse iwanu, ila twolonga kwe tsimbutsi itsilangulitsighwe ne Ghumuhe, twolonga ipfinu pfa umuhe wa ukweli kwa awala iwane Ghumuhe. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Imunu yalihela Ghumuhe we Imulungu ng'odaha bae kubokela aghala igholawa kwe Imulungu, kwaapfila ghakoneka gha ubotsi kuna yeye, na ng'oghatanga bae, kwaapfila ghomanyika kwa kwapfilighwa ne Ghumuhe. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Lekeni imunu wowose yane Ghumuhe we Imulungu, kodaha kughatanga ghose, na kuduhu imunu iyodaha kumuhigha. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Yuhi yatsimanyile tsimbutsi tse Imtwatsa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Yuhi yodaha kumlangulitsa Imtwatsa?” Lekeni twetwe tuna tsimbutsi tse Kiristu.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Iwatumwa we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ndughu tsangu, nene silongile namwe bae ka iwanu imli ne Ghumuhe we Imulungu, lekeni tsanonga namwe ka iwanu we isi ino, ka iwana wadowado mne ukumtoghola Kiristu, <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Tsaniweng'a matombo na si chijo chikomu bae, kwaapfila ng'amdahile bae kuchija. Hata sambi ng'amdaha bae kuchija. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Kwaapfila mwemwe mng'ali mwokala ka iwanu we isi yose pfawokala. Angu pfii kuduhu chepfu na kwisonga mghati mwenu? Agho ghose gholangusa mwemwe mng'ali mwa iwanu we isi yose, na mwokala ka isi yose pfaibama. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Imunu yumwe ang'alonga, “Nene nomuwinza Pauli,” na munu yungi kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Apolo.” Apfi ng'amtenda bae ka iwanu we isi yose pfawotenda?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Angu Apolo nani? Na Pauli nani? Twetwe twa iwatumwa we Imulungu yatumghalileni mwemwe ukutoghola, na chila munu kotenda isang'ano iyeng'ighwe ne Imtwatsa. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Nene nihanda imbeghu, Apolo kaimwaghila ghamatsi, lekeni Imulungu iyo yaitendile ikule. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Apfo iyahandile si chinu bae wala ayula iyaimwaghile ghamatsi, ila Imulungu yaliyeka yaitendile yote, iyo imkulu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Imunu yaihandile na imunu yaimwaghile ghamatsi wose weghala, na Imulungu katsomghweka chila imunu kwa sang'ano yake yaitendile. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Kwaapfila twose twosang'ana hamwe ne Imulungu, mwemwe ka mghunda we Imulungu na ka ing'anda ye Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa ligweko lyangaile Imulungu, nyika lukwalambatsa ka imunu yadahile kutsenga pfinoghile, na imunu yungi kotsenga mchang'a mwake. Lekeni chila imunu iyotsenga yalangitse pfoyotsenga mchang'a mwake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kuduhu imunu yungi iyodaha kwika lukwalambatsa lungi kubita yalwikighwe, iyo Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Mchang'a mwe lukwalambatsa alo, imunu yumwe kodaha kutsengela nzahabu, au kutsengela pfetsa, au kutsengela ghamadini au kutsengela mibiki, au kutsengela tsinyasi au mitsani. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Ukunogha kwe isang'ano ya chila imunu kutsolangusighwa na kwikighwa mwatsi mne litsuwa lya Kiristu, kwaapfila mne litsuwa alyo ghumoto ghutsoghubula isang'ano ya chila imunu, ghumoto ghutsoghetsa tsisang'ano tsawo na kulangusa ka tsinogha. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ka isang'ano ye imunu ng'ailakale mmoto, imunu ayo katsobokela lighweko. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Isang'ano ye imunu ing'alakala, imunu ayo katsolyaghitsa lighweko, lekeni yeye mwenyegho katsokombolighwa, ka kaswekuka mmoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Angu ng'ammanyile bae ka mwemwe mwa Ing'anda ye Imulungu, na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kokala mghati mwenu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Apfo imunu ang'aihinya ing'anda ye Imulungu, Imulungu katsomhinya. Kwaapfila ing'anda ye Imulungu idegheta, namwe mwa ing'anda ye Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Uleke kwighutsukila mwenyegho, imunu wowose yali mghati mwenu ang'eghoda kana nzewele mne isi ino, ng'apfu yawe mbotsi ili yawe na nzewele ya kweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kwaapfila nzewele ye isi ino ya ubotsi hambele he Imulungu. Ka pfayandikighwe, “Imulungu kowaghogha iwanu wane nzewele mne ukukengela kwawo.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Kuya yandikighwa, “Imtwatsa koghamanya aghala ighawakwalangula iwanu wane nzewele ka ng'aghanoghile bae.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Apfo imunu aleke kwighodela aghala ghawotenda iwanu. Mana ghose ghenu mwemwe. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Yawe Pauli au yawe Apolo au Kefa au isi au ughima au lifwa au aghala ghali baha, au aghala ighakutsa, mana ghose ghenu mwemwe. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Mwemwe mwa iwanu we Kiristu, na Kiristu ka we Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa wa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Iwanu watwone twetwe ka twawatumighwa wa Kiristu, yatwing'ighwe ing'onde ye kuwapetela iwanu tsimbuli itsipfisike tse Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Lelo ichibamighwa awala iweng'ighwe isang'ano wawe iwanu iwotogholighwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Kuna nene si chinu bae ning'ahighighwa na mwemwe au ne imunu wowose. Wala nene sihigha nimwenyegho bae. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Mmoyo mwangu sihighighwa bae ne chinu chochose bae, lekeni chinu acho ng'achilangusa ka nahela totso. Imulungu iyo yonihigha nene. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Apfo mleke kuhigha mbuli yoyose ng'ana chipindi chake chipfike, mbetetse mbaka Imtwatsa hayatsakutsa. Katsoghubula aghala ighapfisighwe mchisi na katsogheka mwatsi aghala ighali mmoyo mwe iwanu. Baho chila imunu katsobokela sifa yake kulawa kwe Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Ndughu tsangu, nimtumila Apolo na nene mwenyegho ili kubitila twetwe mwilangulitse mbuli ino, “Mghakinde ighandikighwe mne Ghamaandiko.” Mleke kwighodela munu yuno na kumbetsa yungi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Yuhi iyakutendile mkulu kubita munu yungi? Apfi Imulungu ng'akwing'ile bae pfose pfawinapfo? Ka kwing'ighwa, lelo ule wighoda ka ng'wing'ighwe bae?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Haya, ma mghapata ghose! Lelo ma muwa matajiri! Muwa wandewa bila ya twetwe! Nobama mng'awile iwandewa ili tuwe wandewa hamwe na mwemwe! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Kwaapfila nene pfanikona Imulungu katundenda twetwe iwatumighwa tuwe iwanu wa kuchisogho ghendo, ka iwanu iwahighighwe kukomighwa hambele he wamalaika ne iwanu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Twetwe twawabotsi kwaajili ya kumtumikila Kiristu, lekeni mwemwe mna nzewele kwa kwilunga na Kiristu! Twetwe twahela ngupfu, lekeni mwemwe mna ngupfu, mwemwe ng'ambetsighwa bae, lekeni twetwe twobetsighwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mbaka sambi tuna nzala na ng'ilu, twahela chokupfala, twotohighwa sideke, twahela hanu ho ukukala. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Kuya twoghaya kusang'ana kwa ghamoko ghetu wenyegho. Hatulighitwa, twetwe twobaliki, hatudunuzighwa, twetwe todudumila, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />hatulighighwa, twetwe twakwidika ghoya. Mbaka sambi twetwe twakoneka ka mibangu ye isi, na kwa chila imunu twakoneka wabewebewe!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Si kwandika bae agha ghose ili niwaghume chinyala, lekeni nowafunda ka wanangu iwonoghela. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Hata mng'awa ne iwemilitsi wengi kwa kwilunga ne Kiristu, lekeni aba wenu yumwe yaliheka, kwaapfila kwa kwilunga na Yesu Kiristu nene niwa aba wenu kwa kuwaghalila Imbuli Inoghile. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Apfo nowalomba mtende ka pfanitenda nene. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Apfo nomghalilani Timoteo, imwanangu mna ukwilunga na Kiristu iyonoghela na iyotogholighwa. Ayo katsomkumbusani inzila yaniiwinza nene iili mghati mwa Yesu Kiristu. Inzila iyanilangulitsa chila hanu mne makanisa ghose<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Iwanu wamwenga kulawa mna mwemwe wandusa kwighoda, kulonga ka sikutsa bae kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Lekeni Imtwatsa ang'abama, nitsakutsa kuna mwemwe sambi, baho nitsakona mwenyegho, si ghawolonga ghaliheka, ila ne ingupfu iwali nayo iwanu awo iweghoda. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kwaapfila undewa we Imulungu si wa kulongalonga bae, ila wa ingupfu. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Choni ichiwanoghela? Nitse na fimbo, au nitse ne unoghelo na ghumoyo ghuholile?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Mwibaghule ne ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Sambi yolongighwa ghendo ka mghati mwenu kuna ughoni, na ughoni awo ng'ana woneke bae hata kwe iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu. Imunu kowasa na imwehe wa aba wake! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Kuya lelo mdahatse kwighoda! Ing'awile ng'apfu mwemwe mwone usungu, na imunu iyatendile chinu acho yawingighwe mghati mwenu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Hata ka nakutali na mwemwe kwa lukuli, lekeni kwa ghumoyo nahamwe namwe. Ma nimuhigha imunu ayo yatendile chinu acho cha chinyala ka nabaho kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Hamtingana kwa taghwa lya Imtwatsa wetu Yesu nene na hamwe namwe mmoyo, na ngupfu ya Imtwatsa wetu Yesu yabaho, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />mmwing'e Setani imunu ayo lukuli lwake luhinyighwe ili muhe wake ukombolighwe litsuwa alyo Imtwatsa hayatsokutsa kuwahigha iwanu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kwighoda kwenu ng'akunoghile bae, angu ng'ampfimanyile bae ka hamira chidogho yotenda bulunge lya usaghe we chighate liwe kulu? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Muilapfe hamira ya ghumwande ye nzambi ili mdeghete ghendo. Kuya mwitseghala ne bulunge lya usaghe we pfighate pfa sambi ililihela hamira, ka pfambamighwa kuwa. Mana Pasaka wetu, Kiristu, tsakalapfighwa yawe nambiko. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Apfo, tutende chihungo acho cha Paska, si kwa hamira ye ghumwande, hamira ila ye nzambi na ghehile. Bali kwa chighate ing'achighumighwe hamira, iwo ghumoyo ghunoghile na ighulongesa!<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Niwandikilani mne ibaluwa yangu ingi, mleke kwihanganya ne waghoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Silonga bae mleke kwihanganya ne iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu, awala iwaghoni, wabwa, wabapfi na awala iwotamanila pfinyagho. Mana ili kuwahepa iwanu awo wose mwobamighwa mlawe muisi mno. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Lekeni sambi nowandikilani mleke kwihanganya ne imunu wowose iyolonga komtoghola Kiristu aku kamghoni, ka mbwa, kotamanila pfinyagho, kana maligho, kopatika, ka mwihitsi Imunu ka ayo hata ukuja naye mleke.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Angu sang'ano yangu kuwahigha iwanu iwali kunze mwe kingili lyenu? Aku mwemwe ng'amuwahigha iwali mghati mwenu? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Imulungu mwenyegho katsowahigha awo iwali kunze, “Muwingeni imunu yehile iyali mghati mwenu!”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Wakiristu wahighe maghomba ghawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Imunu ang'esonga ne myaghe, ikuwatse yamghale hane libaratsa lye iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu? Ng'ambe kobamighwa yamghale kwe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Angu, ng'ammanyile bae ka iwanu we Imulungu watsoihigha iisi? Ka mwemwe mtsoihigha iisi, ule ng'amdaha bae kuigha maghomba ghano madomado? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Apfi ng'ammanyile bae ka mwemwe mtsowahigha malaika, pfii lelo mne ghamaghomba ighali muisi? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Hampata lighomba, apfi mwowakema iwanu ing'awolitoghola kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu wamuhigheni? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nolonga apfi kuwaghumani mwemwe chinyala. Apfi kuduhu imunu mghati mwenu yane nzewele ye kuhigha lighomba lye wakiristu wayaghe? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Lekeni, mkiristu komghala mkiristu myaghe mne libaratsa na wowaleka iwanu iwang'amnyile Imulungu wawahighe.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Kwa kwighala mwemwe kwa mwemwe kune ghamabalatsa, kolangusa mwemwe mtotsa ghendo. Ambe ing'awile ng'apfu mwemwe kubokighwa pfinu pfenu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Lekeni mwemwe mwobunza na mwoboka, kuya agho mwowatendela wakiristu wayenu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Angu ng'ammanyile bae iwanu wehile ng'awatsouhala bae undewa we Imulungu? Mleke kwighutsukila, si waghoni wala iwanzinzi, wala iwowatamanila pfinyagho, wala awala iwowasa ne iwamale weyawo, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />wala wabapfi, wabwa, iwopatika, wang'enye, iwaboka weyawo, wala wane maligho, awo wose ng'awatsouhala bae undewa we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Wamwenga wenu tsamkala ka iwanu awo. Lekeni nzambi tsenu tsileghusighwa, mtendighwa muwe wenzeluka na mwikighwa kwa litaghwa lye Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu na kwa ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu wetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'uli tsenu tsimtunitse Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Imunu yungi kodaha kulonga, “Nilekelighwa kutenda pfinu pfose,” lekeni si pfinu pfose bae ipfikwapfila. Notoghola ka nodaha kutenda chila chinu, lekeni sileka bae chinu chochose chinongotse. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Ichijo kwaajili ye munda na munda kwaajili ye ichijo, lekeni Imulungu katsofihinya pfose. Lukuli si kwaajili ye ughoni bae, ila kwaajili ye Imtwatsa, naye Imtwatsa koulolesa lukuli. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Imulungu kwa ingupfu yake kamtsiliula Imtwatsa, naye katsotusiliula twetwe pfipfila.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Apfi, ng'ammanyile bae ka ng'uli tsenu pfilungo pfa Kiristu? Lelo nipfisole pfilungo pfa Kiristu nipfilunge na chiweghe? Bae! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ebu ng'ammanyile bae ayula iyelunga na chiweghe kakuwa lukuli lumwe naye? Ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga, “Nawo weli watsakuwa lukuli lumwe.”<verse eid="1CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Lekeni ayula yelunga na Imtwatsa kakuwa naye kwa muhe.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Mkale kutali ne ughoni. Nzambi tsose tsimwenga itsitendighwa ng'atsilagha lukuli, lekeni mghoni kolutendela nzambi lukuli lwake. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Apfi ng'ammanyile bae ka ng'uli tsenu tsa ing'anda ye Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, iyali mghati mwenu, iyamumbokele kulawa kwe Imulungu? Apfo mwemwe mwa wanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Kwaapfila tsamghulighwa kwa bei ng'ulu, apfo mumtunye Imulungu kwa ng'uli tsenu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Ukukwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Apfo kwa mbuli ya aghala ghamwandike; pfinogha imunu yaleke kukwela. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Lekeni kwaapfila kuna ughoni sideke, chila mmale yawe na mwehe wake mwenyegho. Na chila pinga yawe na mmale wake mwenyegho. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Immale yatende chayobamighwa kumtendela mwehe wake, na ipinga yatende chayobamighwa kumtendela immale wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Lukuli lwa mwehe, si lwake yaliyeka bae, ila lwa immale wake pfipfila. Na lukuli lwa mmale si lwake yaliyeka bae ila lwa mwehe wake pfipfila. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Mleke kwiima, ila ka mwilaghana kwa ghamatsuwa chidogho, ili mdahe kukala kwa kumlomba Imulungu, kuya muyile keli ili Setani aleke kuwaghetsa kwaapfila ng'amdaha kududumila.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Aghano noghalonga nene, na si laghitso bae. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Nobama iwanu wawe ka nene pfanili, lekeni chila imunu keng'ighwa ne Imulungu ghweko lyake mwenyegho. Munu yumwe kana lino na munu yungi kana lila.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Apfo kwa awala iwang'ali ng'ana wakwele na awala ng'ana wakwelighwe, nene nolonga pfino; pfinogha wang'akala ka nene pfanili. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Lekeni ka ng'amdaha bae kwikinga wenyegho, mkwele, kwaapfila pfinogha ng'ani kukwela kubita kusulukila.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kwa awala iwakwelighwe na iwakwelile noweng'a laghitso lino, kuya si langu bae ila lye Imtwatsa. Mwehe yaleke kwileka na mmale wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Lekeni ang'atenda apfo, yakale bila ukukwelighwa, au yelamlitse ne immale wake. Naye immale aleke kumleka mwehe wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Kwa awala iwasighale nolonga pfino. Nene mwenyegho, si Imtwatsa bae. Ka immale kana mwehe ing'ayomtoghola Yesu, na mwehe ayo kotoghola kukala na mmale wake, mmale aleke kumleka mwehe wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Na ka ipinga kana immale na immale ayo ng'omtoghola Yesu bae, ila kotoghola kukala na mwehe wake, ipinga ayo aleke kumlema mmale wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kwaapfila immale yula ing'omtoghola Yesu kobokelighwa ne Imulungu kubitila mwehe wake. Na ipinga yula ing'omtoghola Yesu kohenzeluka kubitila immale wake. Ka si pfipfo bae, iwana wenu wang'alekile weha, lekeni ka pfaili, iwana wenu wenzeluka. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ka imunu ing'omtoghola Yesu kobama yamleke myaghe, umleke atende apfo. Immale au ipinga iyotoghola Imulungu ng'oghomighwa bae kutenda apfo. Imulungu katukema twetwe tukale kwa tindiwalo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Umanyatse, lamda ghwe mwehe kutsodaha kumkombola immale wako? Kuya umanyatse ghwe immale lamda kutsodaha kumkombola mwehe wako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkale ka Imulungu pfayamkemileni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Apfo chila imunu yakale ka pfayagholelighwe ne Imulungu, yakale ka pfayakemighwe ne Imulungu. Alino laghitso lyangu kwa makingili ghose ghe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ka imunu hayakemighwe tsakakala kengila ngoma, ayo aleke kwitenda ka ng'ana yengile ng'oma. Na ka imunu hayakemighwe tsakakala ng'engile ng'oma bae, aleke kwingila ng'oma. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kwaapfila, kwingila ngoma au kuleka kwingila ng'oma si chinu bae, ichinu chikulu, kukinda ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Chila imunu yakale ka pfayakemighwe ne Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Apfi, haukemighwe tsakukala mtumwa? Uleke kwalangula, lekeni ka kopata uhuru utumile. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kwaapfila yeye iyakemighwe ne Imtwatsa aku ka mtumwa, ayo kokombolighwa ne Imtwatsa. Pfipfila ayula iyakemighwe aku si mtumwa bae, ayo kakuwa mtumwa wa Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Imulungu kamghulani kwa bei ng'ulu, lelo mleke kuwa watumighwa we iwanu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Sale tsangu, chila munu na akale ka pfayakemighwe, kwaapfila Imulungu kahamwe na mwemwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsa iwanu ng'ana wakwele na wasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Lelo, kwa imbuli ya awala ing'awakwelighwe bae, nene nahela laghitso kulawa kwe Imtwatsa, lekeni nene nolonga ghano ka imunu iyatogholighwe ne libatsi lye Imtwatsa.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Pfanikona nene, ukughaya kwamghaya sambi, pfinogha mwemwe kukala ka pfamli. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Pfii ma kukwela? Uleke kumleka mwehe wako. Pfii ng'una ukwele bae? Uleke kubama ipinga. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Lekeni ung'akwela, ng'utotsa bae, na imwali ang'akwelighwa, ayo ng'ototsa bae, lekeni iwanu ka awo watsopata maghayo mengi ghe ughima uno, lekeni nene nobama agho ghaleke kuwapata mwemwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Sale tsangu, nobama nonge apfi, ghamatsuwa ighasighale si mengi bae, kulawa sambi awala iwakwelile wakale ka ng'awakwelile bae, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />na awala iwolila wawe ka ng'awolila bae na awala wodeng'elela wawe ka ng'awodeng'elela bae. Na awala iwoghula ipfinu, pfinu apfo pfiwe ka si pfawo bae, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />awala iwane sang'ano ne iisi ino wakale ka wahela sang'ano nayo. Kwaapfila ka pfatumanya, iisi ino ya sambi yofosa.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nobama mwemwe mleke kwalangula. Imunu yalihela mwehe kakwalangula sang'ano ye Imtwatsa, pfayatsomnogheletse Imtwatsa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Immale iyakwelile kosang'ana ne tsing'onde tse iisi ili yamnogheletse mwehe wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />naye kokweghighwa ne pfinu pfili. Ipinga yang'akwelighwe au imwali kakwalangula ng'onde tse Imtwatsa ili yawe mwenzeluka mlukuli na mne muhe. Lekeni ipinga iyakwelighwe kakwalangula ng'onde tse iisi, ili yamdeng'eletse mmale wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Nolonga apfi kwaapfila nobama niwapfile. Sibama bae kwingilila uhuru wenu, ila nobama mwemwe mtende ighanoghile na mwilapfe muwenyegho mne tsing'onde tse Imtwatsa bila kuwinza pfinu pfingi.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Imunu ang'ona ng'otenda pfinoghile bae kuleka kumkwela mwali yamlapfile tsengele, na ka ng'odaha bae kukala bila kukwela, na ang'ona mwali wake miyaka yake yofosa, yatende pfayobama, ang'amkwela pinga ayo, ng'otenda nzambi bae. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Lekeni immale ayo ang'alamla imwenyegho kuleka kukwela, na ka kodaha kuleka kusulukila wapinga, ayo katsotenda pfinoghile ghendo kuleka kumkwela imwali ayo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Apfo ayula yobama kukwela kotenda pfinoghile, na ayula yoleka kukwela kotenda pfinoghile ghendo.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Ipinga iyakwelighwe kohighwa na mmale wake ka immale ayo mghima. Lekeni immale wake ang'afa, kodaha kukwelighwa keli na imunu yungi iyombama, lekeni immale ayo yawe iyommanya Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Lekeni pfanikona nene, ng'apfu ghendo ipinga ayo ang'akala yaliheka, na nene nakona pfipfila nina Ghumuhe we Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ipfijo ipfitambikighwe pfinyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Lelo, aino imbuli ye pfijo ipfitambikighwe pfinyagho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Twomanya ghendo ka “twetwe wose tuna chisomo”, ka pfawolonga. Lekeni ukumanya ako kwowatenda iwanu weghode, ila unoghelo wotsenga. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Imunu ang'alonga komanya chinu, ng'omanya chinu bae ka pfoyobamighwa kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Lekeni imunu iyomnoghela Imulungu komanyika na Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Apfo, mne imbuli ye ipfijo ipfitambikighwe pfinyagho, twomanya ghendo ka chinyagho si chinu bae muisi mno, na twomanya ghendo kuduhu Imulungu yungi ila Imulungu wetu yaliyeka. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Hata ka kuna pfinu ipfikemighwa milungu muisi mno au kulanga, na hata ka kuna milungu ne iwandewa wengi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />lekeni kuna twetwe Imulungu ka yumwe; Aba, yalumbile pfinu pfose, kubitila yeye twetwe twa waghima. Kuya tuna Imtwatsa yumwe, iyo Yesu Kiristu, kubitila yeye pfinu pfose tsapfilumbighwa, na twetwe twa waghima kubitila yeye.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Lekeni si chila imunu bae komanya agha ghose. Iwanu wamwenga iwatsowele kutambikila pfinyagho, mbaka leloli wang'aja ichijo acho wotonga chilawa kwe ipfinyagho. Na kwaapfila mimoyo yawo yahela ingupfu, wetenda iwenyegho weha kwa ukuja ichijo acho. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ichijo ng'achidaha bae kukughala habehi ne Imulungu, tung'aleka kuchija ng'atuhungukighwa na chinu bae, tung'aja ng'atukongetsighwa chinu bae.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Lekeni mwalangitse pfamlekelelighwe ukutenda pfinu, mleke kuwahonza awalaiwotoghola chidogho wengile mnzambi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ka imunu yotoghola chidogho kakona ghweghwe iumanyile kwakuja mne ng'anda ye pfinyagho, pfii ng'atsoghumighwa ghumoyo bae kuja ichijo ichitambikighwe pfinyagho? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Apfo imunu yuno yane noghola ilihela ngupfu, iyo Kiristu yafile kwaajili yake ng'atsakwagha bae kwaajili ya achila ghweghwe kochikema ukumanya? <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ka mwowaghitsa pfino wakiristu wayenu, na kutsilagha noghola tsawo itsilihela ngupfu, mwomtendela nzambi Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Apfo ichijo ching'amtenda mkiristo miyangu yaghwe mnzambi, sitsakuja bae inyama, kwaapfila ning'aja nitsomhonza ndughu yangu yaghwile mnzambi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Sang'ano tse Iwatumighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Angu nene sina ng'ombolighwe bae? Pfii nene si mtumighwa bae? Apfi nene simwonile Imtwatsa wetu Yesu? Angu mwemwe si ghamatunda ghe isang'ano yangu bae? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Hata ka kwa wamwenga nene si mtumighwa bae, lekeni kuna mwemwe nene na mtumighwa. Mwemwe mwa wakalangama we utumighwa wangu kwaapfila mwilunga ne Imtwatsa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Apfi pfipfo pfaniyamila kwe iwanu iwonighutsa. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Pfii ng'atubamighwa ukwing'ighwa bae ichijo na choukunwa kwaajili ye sang'ano yetu? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Apfi twahela haki ye ukumsola mwehe iyomtoghola Kiristu na kwanga naye mne ghumwanza ka pfawotenda iwatumighwa wangi na iwandughu we Imtwatsa na Kefa. <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Au twetwe tuliheka nene na Balinaba itubamighwa kusang'ana ili tupate aghala ighatubama. <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Angu asikali wachi iyoghenda kwing'ondo keliha imwenyegho? Yuhi iyohanda mitsabibu aku ng'akuja bae ghamatunda ghake? Yuhi iyodima iwanyama aku ng'akunwa bae matombo ghawo?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Apfi agha ghanilonga nolonga gha chimunu? Angu Ghamalaghitso gha Musa nagho ng'agholonga apfi bae? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Mana yandikighwa mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, “Haumtumila ing'ombe kupfuna uhunga, uleke kumwoha chibang'wa.” Pfii, Imulungu kolonga mbuli tse ng'ombe? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Apfi hayalongile apfo ng'alongile mbuli tsetu bae? Tsayandikighwa kwaajili ya twetwe ghendo. Kwaapfila ayula iyolima na ayula iyopfuna, wose wana haki yo ukubetela ipfijo. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ka twetwe tuhanda imbeghu ye umuhe mghati mwenu, apfi chinu chikulu twetwe tung'apata aghala ghatubama kulawa kuna mwemwe? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ka wanu wamwenga wodaha ukughalolela agho kulawa kuna mwemwe. Apfi twetwe ng'atudaha bae ukughalolela agho kubita wawo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Lekeni twetwe ng'atutumile bae uwetso awo. Ila tsatududumila chila chinu ili tuleke kuighoma Imbuli Inoghile ye Kiristu.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Apfi ng'ammanyile bae, awala iwosang'ana mne ing'anda ye Imulungu wopata ipfijo pfawo mng'anda amo, na awala iwalapfa nambiko hanu ha kutambikila wopata ipfinu pfe inambiko ayo? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Pfipfila, Imtwatsa kalaghitsa apfi, awala iwopetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile wabokele ipfijo pfawo kulawa mne imbuli inoghile.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Lekeni nene situmile bae uleghelo hata umwe. Wala sighandika bae ghano ili mnendele apfo. Ng'apfu nene nife kubita kumtenda imunu yambone ka nene neghoda hela. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ka nene nopeta Imbuli inoghile, acho si chinu cha kwighodela bae. Ayo iyo sang'ano yaning'ighwe. Na nitsolyona ka siipeta bae Imbuli inoghile! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ning'atenda sang'ano ino kwa ukubama mwenyegho, ning'alolele ukughwekighwa, lekeni ka nene nobamighwa kuitenda sang'ano ayo, ayo yolangusa ka Imulungu kangaya sang'ano ayo niitende. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Lelo nobokela maliho ghachi? Hanipetela iwanu Imbuli inoghile, sibama bae kwing'ighwa chinu, wala silomba maliho kwaajili ye sang'ano ye kupeta Imbuli inoghile.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Nene si mtumwa wa imunu wowose bae. Lekeni netenda imwenyegho kuwa mtumwa wa chila imunu ili nimpatile Kiristu iwanu wengi. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Haning'ali nisang'ana na Wayahudi tsanikala ka Myahudi, ili niwapate Wayahudi; hata ka nene imwenyegho silongotsighwa bae na malaghitso gha Musa, lekeni tsanikala ka nolongotsighwa na malaghitso agho ili niwapate awala iwalongotsighwa na malaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Haning'ali nisang'ana na awala iwalihela malaghitso gha Musa, tsanikala ka nahela malaghitso, ili niwapate awala iwalihela malaghitso gha Musa. Kulonga apfo si ka nene sighawinza malaghitso hambele he Imulungu, kwaapfila nina malaghitso hambele he Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Hanisang'ane na awala wane noghola ilihela ngupfu, tsanikala ka nina noghola yangu yahela ngupfu ka wawo pfawali, ili niwapate awo wane noghola ilihela ngupfu. Nitenda chila chinu kwe iwanu wose ili nidahe kuwatenda wakombolighwe kwa nzila yoyose ila.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Notenda agha ghose kwaajili ya imbuli inoghile, ili mbokele balaka tsake. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Apfi ng'ammanyile bae iwanu hawotsuma, wose wotsuma, lekeni ayula iyowalongola weyaghe iyo iyoghwekighwa? Mtsume pfipfo ili mghwekighwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Imunu wowose iyobama kuwahuma weyaghe mna ukutsuma, tanu kalekagha ghose, kotenda apfo ili yabokele taji ilihinyika, lekeni twetwe twotenda apfo ili tubokele taji ing'alihinyika bae. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Apfo notsuma ka imunu iyobama kuhuma. Sitowa bae ka imunu yetowa ne libeho, <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />ila noludununza lukuli Iwangu luwe na ngupfu na nolutenda luwe mtumwa wangu, notenda apfo ili hanimalitsa kuwapetela iwanu wangi nene imwenyegho ndeke koneka sinoghile bae kubokela ghweko.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Pauli kokanya ukutamanila pfinyagho kulekighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Ndughu tsangu, sibama bae mwemwe mleke kumanya ka aba tsenu tsawahasi mwe libingu lila, na wose tsawaloka mne bahali ila ndung'u. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Wose tsawabatitsighwa wawe ka wa Musa mne libingu na mne ibahali. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Wose tsawaja ichijo chichila che ghumuhe, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />pfipfila tsawanwa chokunwa chichila che ghumuhe, mana tsawanwa kulawa mne bambalawe lye umuhe iliwawinzile, bambalawe lila tsalikala Kiristu imwenyegho. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Lekeni, Imulungu ng'anoghelighwe na wamwenga wawo. Apfo ng'uli tsawo tsatsipwililika mnyika.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Apfo agha ghose ghalawila ili kutukanya tuleke kuwa iwanu wa kusulukila ghehile ka wawo pfawasulukile. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Mleke kutamanila pfinyagho, ka wamwenga pfawatendile. Ka pfayandikighwe, “Iwanu tsawakala hasi waja na wanwa, kuya wema wapfina pfihile.”<verse eid="1CO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Mleke kutenda uweghe, ka iwanu wangi pfawatendile, kwa litsuwa limwe iwanu elufu ishilini na wadatu tsawafa. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Mleke kumghetsa Kiristu ka iwanu wangi pfawamghetsile, wose tsawafa kwa kulumighwa ne wanzoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Mleke kunung'unika ka iwanu wangi pfawatendile, nawo tsawakomighwa na mtumighwa we kulanga we lifwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Agha ghose ghawalawila wawo ili twetwe tulangulitsighwe, ghandikighwa ili ghatukanye twetwe itukala mne ghamatsuwa ighali habehi na utsighilo.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Apfo, ayula iyebona kema pfinoghile, yalangitse aleke kughwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ghamaghetso ghampatile si magheni bae kwe iwanu. Imulungu kotogholighwa, naye ng'atsowaleka mghetsighwe kubita pfamdaha. Lekeni hamghetsighwa, yeye katsoweng'a ingupfu yo kududumila, na inzila yo kulawila.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Lelo ndughu tsangu wanoghelighwa, mkale kutali ne ukutamanila pfinyagho. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nolonga na mwemwe ka iwanu wane tsimbutsi, mwalangule achino chanilonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Hatubaliki ichikombe che ichijo che ukumkumbuka lmtwatsa, apfi ng'atwilunga bae na idamu ya Kiristu? Pfii hatubena chighate ng'atwilunga bae na lukuli lwa Kiristu? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwaapfila hana chighate chimwe, na twetwe yatuli wengi, twalukuli lumwe, mana twetwe wose twegholela chighate chicho.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Muwalole Wayahudi wenyegho, awala iwakuja nambiko welunga ne Imulungu kubitila nambiko atso. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Lelo nonge choni? Ichijo ichitambikighwe pfinyagho chinu chikulu kubita ichijo? Na ipfinyagho chinu chikulu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Bae! Chanilonga nene chicho chino, nambiko tse iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu wowalapfila pfinyamkela, si Imulungu bae. Na nene sibama bae mwilunge na ipfinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ng'amdaha bae kuchinwela ichikombe che Imtwatsa aku mwochinwela chikombe che pfinyamkela. Ng'amdaha ukuja mne metsa ye Imtwatsa na baho mne metsa ya pfinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Angu twobama tumtende Imtwatsa yawe na chepfu. Apfi mwopfikitsa tuna ngupfu kubita yeye?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utende ghose kwa utunitso we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Wamwenga wolonga, “Ipfinu pfose ng'apfighomighwa bae,” lekeni nene nolonga si pfose ipfikwapfila. Kuya wamwenga wolonga, “Ipfinu pfose ng'apfighomighwa bae,” lekeni nene nolonga, si pfose ipfitsenga. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Imunu wowose mna mwemwe aleke kwibamila yaliyeka ghanoghile, ila yawabamile na weyaghe.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Mje chochose ichihutsighwa mne maghulilo bila kughutsaghutsa kwaajili ye imimoyo yenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Isi ya Imulungu na ghose ighali mumo ghake.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ka imunu ing'ayomtoghola Yesu komkemani mkaje ichijo kaye yake, namwe mwobama kughenda, mje chochose ichikighwe hambele henu bila kughutsaghutsa kwaajili ya imimoyo yenu. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Lekeni imunu yungi ang'akulongela, “Chijo chino chitambikighwa pfinyagho,” uleke kuja kwaajili ye imunu iyakulongele na kwa kwaajili ya ghumoyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Nolonga, kwaajili ya ghumoyo ghwa munu yungi si kwaajili ya ghumoyo ghwako bae, Imunu yungi ang'aghutsa, “Ule lelo ukukombolighwa kwangu kuhighighwe ne ghumoyo ghwe imunu yungi? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ka nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu kwa ichijo chanikuja, ebali imunu yungi yanonge pfihile kwa ichijo acho?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Apfo, chochose chamtenda, ukuja au ukunwa, mtende ghose kwa utunitso we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Mleke kuwatenda Wayahudi wala Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi, wala makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu wekwale. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Muwe ka nene, nene nobama kuwadeng'eletsa wanu wose mna ghose ghanitenda. Mana sibamila niliheka ghanoghile, ila nowabamila ghanoghile iwanu wose ili wakombolighwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Mniwinze ka nene pfanimuwinzile Kiristu.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukughubika litwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nomtunyani kwa kunikumbuka, ne ukughakinda malaghitso ghaniweng'ileni. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Lekeni nobama mwemwe mmanye pfino, Kiristu iyo litwi lya chila mmale, na mmale iyo litwi lya pinga wake, na Imulungu iyo litwi lya Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Apfo imunu wowose iyolomba au iyopeta usenga iulawa kwe Imulungu aku kaghubika litwi lyake, ayo komghuma chinyala Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Na ipinga wowose hayolomba au hayopeta usenga we Imulungu aku litwi lyake ng'alighubikighwe bae, komghuma chinyala mmale wake, ipinga ayo keghala na ipinga iyaghetile mvili tsake tsose. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ka ipinga ng'oghubika bae litwi lyake, ng'apfu yabehe mvili tsake. Lekeni ka chinyala kwe ipinga kugheta mvili tsake au kubeha mvili tsake, yaghubike litwi lyake<verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Immale ng'obamighwa bae yaghubike litwi lyake, kwaapfila yeye keghala ne Imulungu na ka utunitso we Imulungu. Lekeni ipinga ka utunitso we immale. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Kwaapfila, immale ng'alawile bae kwe ipinga, ila ipinga kalawa kwe immale. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Immale ng'alumbighwe bae kwaajili ye ipinga, ila ipinga tsakalumbighwa kwaajili ya immale. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Apfo kwaajili ye malaika, ipinga yaghubike litwi lyake, ili chiwe chitango cha uwetso uli mchanya mwake. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Lekeni, hambele he Imtwatsa ipinga ng'omuhila bae immale, na immale ng'omuhila bae ipinga. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Mana ka ipinga pfayalawile kwe immale, pfipfila immale naye kakwelekighwa ne ipinga, lekeni ghose gholawa kwe Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Mlamle wenyegho, angu pfinogha kwe ipinga kumlomba Imulungu aku ng'aghubike bae chinu chochose mwitwi mwake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Hata iwanu pfatulumbighwe pfolangusa ghendo, mmale kuwa na mvili ng'ulu chinyala kuna yeye, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />lekeni ipinga ang'awa na mvili ng'ulu, acho chinu chinoghile kuna yeye. Kwaapfila keng'ighwa mvili ng'ulu tsimghubike. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Imunu ang'abama kwihisanya mna mbuli ino, twetwe twahela matsowela ghangi. Wala makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu ghahela matsowela ghangi.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chijo che ukukumbuka lifwa lye Imtwatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Malk 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Mne malaghitso ghano ghanimwing'ani siwatunya bae, mana mne mitingano yenu yo ukumtamanila Imulungu mwotenda ghehile ghendo kubita ighanoghile. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Aho mwanduso tsanihulika hamtingana mne mitingano yenu mwebaghula. Nani chidogho notoghola, <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />mana kobamighwa kuwe na ubaghutsi mghati mwenu, ili awala iwatogholighwe ne Imulungu woneke pfinoghile. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Hamtingana hamwe, mwopfikitsa mwakuja ichijo che ukumkumbuka Imtwatsa, kumbe bae! <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kwaapfila hamkuja, chila munu koghendelela ukuja bila kuwabeta wayenu, mbaka wangi wokala ne nzala aku wamwenga wapatika. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Angu ng'amdaha bae ukuja na kunwa mmakae mwenu? Ebu mwolibesa kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu, na kuwaghuma chinyala iwanu iwalihela chinu? Lelo niwalongeleni choni? Niwatunye? Mbe siwatunya bae kwaajili ya chinu acho.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Mana nighabokela kulawa kwe Imtwatsa ghamalangulitso ghanimwing'eni, Imtwatsa Yesu chilo chila chayahundukighwe, tsakasola chighate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />hayamalitse kulonga mighede kwe Imulungu, kachibena, kalonga, “Aluno lukuli lwangu, lwamwing'ighwe mwemwe, mtende apfi kwa kung'umbuka nene.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Pfipfila hayamalitse ukuja, kasola chikombe, kalonga, “Chikombe chino laghano lya sambi lye idamu yangu. Mtende apfi chila hamkunwa kwa kung'umbuka nene.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Mana chila hamkuja chighate chino na kuchinwela chikombe chino, mwolipeta lifwa lye Imtwatsa, mbaka hayatsakuya keli. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Apfo imunu wowose iyakuja chighate chino na kuchinwela chikombe che Imtwatsa ing'apfibamighwa, ayo katsokuwa na totso kwa lukuli na idamu ye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Apfo, chila imunu tanu yelolese mwenyegho, kuya kodaha ukuja chighate acho na ukunwela chikombe acho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Mana imunu wowose iyakuja na kunwa bila kulutanga lukuli lwe Imtwatsa chinu chachi, ayo kehigha imwenyegho. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Kwaajili ayo iwanu wengi mghati mwenu wahela ingupfu na watamu, na wamwenga wafa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Twing'elolesa pfinoghile, tung'alekile kuhighighwa ne Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Lekeni hatuhighighwa ne Imtwatsa twolangulisighwa tunoghe ili tuleke kuhighighwa hamwe ne iisi yose.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Apfo ndughu tsangu, hatwitingana hamwe ukuja ichijo che Imtwatsa, chila munu yambete myaghe. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Imunu ang'awa ne nzala, aje ukaye yake ili hamtingana kuleke kuwa ne ukuhighighwa ne Imulungu. Lekeni agho ghangi, nitsowalangulitsani hanikutsa.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pfigholelo kulawa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Lelo ndughu tsangu nobama mmanye pfinoghile mbuli tse pfigholelo ipfilawa kwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Mwomanya hamng'ali ng'ana mumtange Imulungu, tsamlongosighwa mne nzila tsihile muitamanile milungu ilihela ughima. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Nobama mmanye pfino, kuduhu imunu iyolongosighwa ne Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu iyodaha kulonga “Yesu yalighitighwe,” kuya kuduhu imunu iyodaha kulonga “Yesu iyo Imtwatsa,” bila kulongosighwa na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Kuna pfigholelo pfingi tofwautitofwauti, lekeni Ghumuhe iyopfilapfa ka yumwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Kuya kuna nzila tofwautitofwauti tsa sang'ano, lekeni Imtwatsa ka yumwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Kuya kuna nzila tofwautitofwauti tse kutenda sang'ano atso, lekeni Imulungu iyo yuyo iyosang'ana ng'onde tsose kwe iwanu wose. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kelangusa kwa chila imunu kwa nzila tofwautitofwauti kwaajili ye iwanu wose. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ghumuhe komwing'a imunu yumwe mbuli tsa nzewele, Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi uwetso we ukumanya pfinu. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi ukutoghola, na Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi uwetso wa kuwahonetsa iwanu. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka komwing'a imunu yumwe uwetso we kutenda pfihulo, Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi uwetso we kulapfa unabii na imunu yungi kubaghula pfigholelo ipfili pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na ipfili si pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka bae, yungi kulonga lugha ing'atsimanyika bae, na yungi kutsifasiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Atso tsose sang'ano tsa yuyo yumwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, naye komgholela chila imunu ka pfoyobama imwenyegho.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lumwe lekeni pfilungo pfingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Lukuli lwa lumwe, hata ka lulumbighwa na pfilungo pfingi, na hata ka una pfilungo pfingi, lekeni pfolumba lukuli lumwe. Apfo pfipfo pfaili kwa Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Kwaapfila twetwe wose tsatubatitsighwa kwa Ghumuhe yumwe, tuwe Wayahudi au si Wayahudi bae, tuwe watumwa au si watumwa bae, wose tunwesighwa Ghumuhe yuyula yumwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Kwaapfila lukuli ng'alulumbighwe bae kwa chilungo chimwe, ila kwa pfilungo pfingi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Mghulu ung'alonga, “Kwaapfila nene sili ghumoko bae, nene si wa lukuli.” Apfi mghulu utsokuwa si wa lukuli bae? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Na lighutwi ling'alonga, “Kwaapfila nene sili inenge bae, nene si wa lukuli bae.” Apfi lighutwi litsokuwa si lya lukuli bae? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ka lukuli lwose lung'awile inenge, ukuhulika kung'akalile kwani? Na lukuli lwose lung'awile lighutwi, ukunusa kung'akalile kwani? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Lekeni Imulungu keka pfilungo pfose mne lukuli lwa chila munu ka pfayabamile pfiwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ka pfilungo pfose pfing'awile chilungo chimwe, lukuli lung'akalile kwani! <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ka pfaili, kuna pfilungo pfingi, lekeni lukuli lwa lumwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Inenge ng'aidaha bae kughulongela ghumoko, “Sikubama bae!” Wala litwi ng'alidaha bae kughalongela maghulu “Simbamani bae!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Lekeni kubita agho, yolangusa ipfilungo pfila ipfikoneka pfahela ngupfu, apfo pfipfo chinu chikulu, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />na pfilungo pfila pfatulonga pfahela heshima, twopfing'a heshima ng'ulu, na pfilungo ipfikoneka ng'apfinoghile, twopfighubika pfinoghile. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Lekeni pfilungo pfetu ipfinoghile sideke ng'apfibama bae kuhambighwa. Imulungu mwenyegho kalwika pfipfo lukuli, na kapfing'a heshima pfilungo pfila ipfihungukighwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Apfo kuleke kuwa na ubaghutsi mne lukuli, ila pfilungo pfose pfilolese. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Chilungo chimwe ching'atama, pfilungo pfose pfotama hamwe nacho, na chilungo chimwe ching'atunyighwa, pfilungo pfose pfodeng'elela hamwe nacho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Apfo chila munu mghati mwenu ka lukuli lwa Kiristu, na chila munu ka chilungo cha lukuli alwo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Na mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu, Imulungu keka wa mwanduso iwatumighwa, wa keli manabii, wa kadatu iwalangulitsi, wa kane awala iwotenda pfihulo, na wala iweng'ighwe ingupfu yo kuwahonetsa iwatamu, na iwodaha kuwapfila iwanu wangi, kuya pfilongotsi na iwolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Si wanu wose bae watumighwa au manabii au walangulitsi. Na si wose bae iwotenda pfihulo. <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Si wose iwodaha kuhonetsa iwanu. Si wose iwolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Apfo mbame pfigholelo pfikulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Nani leloli nowalangusa nzila inoghile kubita nzila tsose.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Unoghelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Hata ka nodaha kulonga lugha tse iwanu na tse wamalaika we kulanga, lekeni ka nahela unoghelo, nene neghala na malati iikema hela au tsimbughi. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Hata ka nodaha kupeta usenga we Imulungu, na kumanya ghose na mbuli na kutanga chila chinu, hata ka nodaha kusoghetsa pfighongo kwa ukutoghola kwangu, lekeni ka nahela unoghelo, nene si chinu bae. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Hata ka ning'aweng'a iwahingwa pfinu pfose pfanilinapfo na kulwika lukuli lwangu lulakale mlambi, lekeni ka nahela unoghelo, nene sipata chinu bae.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Munu yane unoghelo kodudumila, kana libatsi, kahela chepfu, ng'etunya bae wala ng'eghoda bae. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Imunu yane unoghelo kana mahala, ng'abamagha bae mbuli tsake mwenyegho, ng'asumkagha bae kona maya, kuya ng'ekagha bae fondogholo mmoyo. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Imunu yane unoghelo ng'odeng'elelela bae ghehile, ila kodeng'elela ukweli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Yane unoghelo kodudumila ghamatsuwa ghose, kotoghola ghamatsuwa ghose, ghamatsuwa ghose kololela bila kwipfa, kodudumila ghamatsuwa ghose.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Unoghelo ng'autsighagha bae, ka hana unabii, awo utsotsigha, ka hana ukulonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, ako kutsomala, ka hana ukumanya, kutsoluta. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Mana ukumanya kwetu ng'akutimile bae, na ukulapfa unabii kwetu ng'akutimile bae, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />lekeni Imulungu hayatsotimilitsa ghose, achila ing'achitimile chitsohupa.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Haning'ali mdodo, tsanonga ka mwana mdodo, tsanyalangula ka mwana mdodo, tsanimanya ka mwana mdodo. Lekeni hanikulile nighaleka aghala gha udodo. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Mana sambi twolola ka chihanga ing'achikoneka pfinoghile bae mne chilolelo, lekeni hambele tutsolola chihanga kwa chihanga. Ghanimanya sambi ng'aghatimile bae, kuya hambele nitsomanya ghose ka Imulungu pfonimanya.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Lelo pfinu pfidatu ipfighendelela; kuko ukutoghola na lolelo na unoghelo, lekeni chikulu kubita pfose uwo unoghelo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Pfinu pfimwenga pfe Ghumuhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Muubame unoghelo, na mbame pfigholelo pfingi pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, kubita pfose mpate chigholelo cha kuwapetela iwanu usenga we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Kwapfila imunu wowose iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, ayo ng'olonga bae ne iwanu, ila kolonga ne Imulungu, kwaapfila kuduhu imunu iyohulika. Kolonga pfinu ipfipfisike kwa ngupfu ye Ghumuhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Lekeni awala iwopeta usenga we Imulungu wolonga ne iwanu na kuwapfila, kuwaghuma ghumoyo na kuwakanza. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Ayula iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, ketsenga mwenyegho, ila ayula iyopeta usenga we Imulungu kowatsenga iwanu we Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Nene nobama mwemwe mwose mlonge kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, lekeni kubita alyo nobama mwemwe mlonge usenga we Imulungu. Kwaapfila ayula iyolonga usenga we Imulungu kotenda ghanoghile kubita ayula iyolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika, ila ka kabaho imunu yungi iyodaha kuwafasilila iwanu choni chayalongile, ili iwanu wose we Imulungu wadahe kwapfilighwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Lelo ndughu tsangu, ning'atsa kuna mwemwe na kulonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, angu mwemwe mtsobweda choni? Ng'amtsobweda bae! Ila ka nolonga namwe kwa nzila ya ughubulo, au ukumanya, au imbuli ye Imulungu au malangulitsi.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Hata ipfinu ipfilihela ughima ipfilapfa litsi kaapfila ichimbeta au chilimba, ka ng'apfilapfa bae litsi tofwautitofauti, imunu yatsomanyatse wila wachi iutowighwa? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ka malati ng'ailapfa bae litsi pfinoghile, yuhi yatseyandaa kughenda kwing'onde? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Na mwemwe pfipfila, ka ghamlonga ng'aghomanyika bae, yuhi iyodaha kumanya mlonga choni? Apfo mwakuwa ka iwanu iwolonga na libeho. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Muisi mna lugha nyingi, lekeni tsose tsomanyika. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Ka simanya bae ichilongighwa ne imunu yungi, nene nakuwa mgheni kwa imunu ayo iyolonga na nene, naye kakuwa mgheni kuna nene. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Pfipfila na mwemwe wose, kwaapfila mwobama ghendo kubokela pfigholelo pfe Ghumuhe, mtende pfomdaha kongesa pfigholelo ipfiwatenda iwanu we Imulungu wabwede.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Apfo ayula iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, yalombe yadahe kuwafasilila iwanu achila chalongile. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Mana ning'alomba kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, muhe wangu nawo wolomba, lekeni mbutsi tsangu ng'atsitenda chinu bae. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Lelo nitendetse? Nitsolomba kwa ghumuhe wangu, pfipfila nitsolomba kwa mbutsi tsangu, nitsakwimba kwa ghumuhe wangu, pfipfila nitsakwimba kwa mbutsi tsangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ung'amtunya Imulungu wako kwa ghumuhe wako uliheka, ka kuna imunu ing'ayomanya chaulonga, yodahatse kwidika “Ona” haulonga mighede kwe Imulungu ka ng'omanya bae chaulonga? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Kwodaha kulonga mighede kwe Imulungu pfinoghile, lekeni ng'aitsomwapfila bae imunu yungi.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu kwaapfila nene nolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika kubita mwemwe wose. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Lekeni mne likanisa nonoghelighwa kulonga malonga matano ighomanyika, ili nidahe kuwalangulitsa iwanu wengi kubita kulonga malonga mengi kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Ndughu tsangu mleke kutonga ka iwana wadowado, lekeni muwe iwana wadowado mna aghala ghehile, hamtonga muwe ka iwanu wabala. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Yandikighwa mne ghamalaghitso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Imtwatsa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Kwa nzila ye iwolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">na kwa milomo ya iwahenza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">nitsolonga ne iwanu wano, hata apfo ng'awatsonihulikitsa bae.’ ”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Apfo ukulonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, acho chitango kwa awala ing'awotoghola bae, lekeni si kwa awala iwotoghola, lekeni ukupeta usenga we Imulungu, acho chitango kwa awala iwotoghola na si kwa awala ing'awotoghola bae.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Lelo ka iwanu wose we Imulungu wetingana hamwe na chila imunu kolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika, na awala ing'awomanya na ing'awotoghola wang'engila, angu ng'awatsolonga bae ka mna lukwale? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Lekeni wose wang'alonga usenga iweng'ighwe ne Imulungu, iwanu ing'awomanya au ing'awotoghola wang'engila, watsoghahulika ghose ghamlonga, nagho ghatsowahigha. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Na aghala ighapfisike mmoyo mwawo ghatsoghubulighwa, nawo watsopfughama na kumtamanila Imulungu, aku wolonga; “Imulungu ka mghati mwenu ghendo!”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Choni chitendeke mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ndughu tsangu, lelo tulonge choni? Hamtingana hamwe kumtamanila Imulungu, yumwe yembe wila, yungi yalangulitse, na yungi yawe na ughubulo iulawa kwe Imulungu, ayu yalonge kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, yungi yawafasilile iwanu achila ichilongighwe. Ghose ghatendeke kwa kuwapfila iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Imunu wowose ang'alonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, iwanu weli au wadatu walonge, lekeni walonge yumweyumwe aku kukale na imunu yungi iyowafasilila achila ichilongighwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Lekeni ka kuduhu imunu iyowafasilila iwanu achila ichilongighwa, imunu iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika yanyamale, na yelongele mwenyegho ne Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Iwanu weli au wadatu iweng'ighwe usenga we Imulungu walonge aku iwanu wangi walamule achila ichilongighwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Lekeni ka imunu yali mne mtingano kabokela usenga we Imulungu, ayula iyolonga yanyamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Kwaapfila mwose mwodaha kulonga yumweyumwe usenga wamwing'ighwe ne Imulungu, ili chila imunu yelangulitse na yaghumighwe ghumoyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Muhe tse manabii tsowategheletsa manabii. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Kwaapfila Imulungu si Imulungu wa kutenda pfinu chakachaka bae, ila yeye ka Imulungu wa tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Pfipfila ka pfaili mne makingilli ghe iwanu we Imulungu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />iwapinga wanyamale mne makingilli ghe iwanu we Imulungu, ng'awobamighwa bae kulonga, wala kulongotsa ka Ghamalaghitso gha Wayahudi pfagholonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Wang'abama kumanya mbuli yoyose ila, wawaghuse wamale wawo ukaye yawo, mana chinu cha chinyala kwe ipinga kulonga mbuli yoyose mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Pfii mwopfikitsa imbuli ye Imulungu ilawa kuna mwemwe au iwapfikila mwemwe mliheka? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Imunu wowose iyebona keng'ighwa usenga we Imulungu au kana gholelo lya Ghumuhe, yatange ghendo ka chanikwandika, nakwandika laghitso lye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Imunu ang'aghabetsa ghano, naye yabetsighwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Apfo ndughu tsangu, msulukile kuwalongela iwanu imbuli ye Imulungu, kuya mleke kuwaghoma iwanu kulonga lugha ing'atsimanyika. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ghose ghatendeke ghoya na pfinoghile.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kutsilihuka kwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Lelo ndughu tsangu nobama niwalongele keli Imbuli Inoghile yaniwapetele, yamuibokele iili lukwalambatsa lwa ukutogha kwenu, na mna ayo mwemwe mwakwima ghendo. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Usenga awo yaniwapetele iyo Imbuli Inoghile, mwemwe mwokombolighwa mng'ahakinda ghoya aghala ghaniwapetele, ka si pfipfo bae mtoghola hela.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Niwagholela aghala ghanibokele nene mwenyegho, Kiristu tsakafa kwa nzambi tsetu ka pfagholonga Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />tsakasikighwa, na katsilihuka mna litsuwa lya kadatu, ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />tanu tsakamlawila Petiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">taghwa lyake lingi Kefa</char></note> kuya kawalawila watumighwa wose 12. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Pfipfila kawalawila ndughu ka 500 kwa mala lumwe, wengi mna wawo waghima mbaka sambi, lekeni wangi wawo ma wahupa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Hambele kamlawila Jakobu, kuya kawalawila watumighwa wose.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Pfipfila kandawila nene, ka imunu yanyelekighwe mne chipindi si chake bae. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kwaapfila nene na mtumighwa mdodo, sinoghile bae kukemighwa mtumighwa, kwaapfila tsanighadununza makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Lekeni uluso we Imulungu, unitenda niwe ka pfino pfanili, uluso wangaile, ng'angaile hela bae. Nene tsanisang'ana kubita iwatumighwa wose, si nene bae, ila uluso we Imulungu tsausang'ana hamwe na nene. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Hata apfo iwe nene au wawo iwoipeta Imbuli inoghile si chinu bae, acho chicho chatupeta na chicho chamtoghola.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Lekeni ka tsaipetighwa Kiristu katsilihuka, wamwenga wenu wodahatse kulonga kuduhu kutsilihuka? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ka kuduhu kutsilihuka kwe iwanu, apfo Kiristu naye ng'atsilihuke bae, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />kuya ka Kiristu ng'atsilihuke bae, chatuwapetela si chinu bae, pfipfila chamtoghola si chinu bae. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kubita ghose, pfipfila twetwe twoneka tulonga ughutsu hambele he Imulungu, kwaapfila tsatulonga Imulungu kamtsilihula Kiristu, kumbe ng'amtsilihule bae, ka iwanu iwafile ng'awotsilihuka bae. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kwaapfila ka iwafile ng'awatsilihuka bae, Kiristu naye ng'atsilihuke bae. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Kuya ka Kiristu ng'atsilihuke bae, ukutoghola kwenu kwahela sang'ano, na nzambi tsenu mng'ali natso. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Pfipfila wanu iwafile aku womtoghola Kiristu wagha. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ka tumlolela Yesu Kiristu mna ughima uno uliheka, twobamighwa twonelighwe libatsi kubita iwanu wose.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Lekeni kwo ukulongesa ghendo Kiristu katsilihuka, yeye iyo wa mwanduso we iwanu iwawasile mlifwa, apfo yolangusa iwanu wangi watsotsilihuka. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Mana ka lifwa lighalighwa ne imunu yumwe, pfipfila kutsilihuka nako kughalighwa ne imunu yumwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ka iwanu wose pfawakufa kwa ukwilunga na Adamu, pfipfila kubitila Kiristu iwanu wose watsakuwa waghima. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Lekeni chila imunu na hanu hake, tanu Kiristu, kuya awala iwali wake Kiristu hayatsakuya. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Kuya utsighilo utsakutsa, Kiristu hayatsomwing'a Undewa Aba Imulungu, hayamalitsa kuhinya utawala na ukulu na ngupfu tsose itsihile. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kwaapfila Kiristu kobamighwa yatawale mbaka Imulungu yaweke iwanebe wose hasi he ghamaghulu ghake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Lifwa iyo mwihile wa usighilo iyatsokomighwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Mana Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Imulungu keka pfinu pfose hasi he maghulu ghake.” Lekeni ghamaandiko hagholonga, “Pfinu pfose pfikighwa hasi he maghulu ghake yapfitawale,” yakoneka ghendo Imulungu ng'alimumo bae mna pfinu apfo, kwaapfila yeye iyo iyekile pfinu apfo hasi he ghamaghulu gha Kiristu. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Lekeni hayatsakwika pfinu pfose hasi he ghamaghulu gha Kiristu, naye Imwana katseika mwenyegho hasi he Imulungu, ili Imulungu yatawale ghendo chila chinu chila hanu.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Lelo ka kuduhu kutsilihuka, watsotendatse awala iwabatitsighwe kwaajili ye iwanu iwafile? Ka iwafile ng'awotsilihuka bae, ule iwanu wobatisighwa kwaajili yawo? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Na twetwe, ebali twehonza chila saa? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Wandughu, noulapfa ughima wangu chila litsuwa, neghoda kwaajili yenu mna ukwilunga na Yesu Kiristu Imtwatsa wetu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Ka ukwitowa kwangu ne iwanu iwakalile ka iwanyama wane usongo akula Efeso tsanitowa kwa mbuli tse chimunu, angu nipatile choni? Lekeni iwanu iwafile ka ng'awotsilihulighwa bae, leka, “Tuje na tunwe kwaapfila ilupfi twakufa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Mleke kughutsukighwa. “Usale wihile wohinya chitsowelo chinoghile.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Mlamke lelo! Mleke kutenda nzambi, kwaapfila kuna iwanu wamwenga mghati mwenu ng'awammanyile ghendo Imulungu, chinyala kuna mwemwe kwa ghano ghanongile.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu pfawatsotsilihulighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Lekeni munu kodaha kughutsa, “Apfi iwanu wotsilihukatse? Watsokuwa na lukuli lwachi?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Mleke kuwa wabotsi! Imbeghu yuhanda ng'aikota bae mbaka ife tanu. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Hauhanda, kohanda imbeghu iliheka, iwe ya uhemba au ya mitama au mbeghu tsingi, ng'uhanda mbiki wose iulawila hambele. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Lekeni Imulungu koing'a mbeghu ayo lumbo ka pfoyobama na chila mbeghu ina lumbo lyake.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ng'uli tse pfilumbe ng'atsighala bae. Iwanu wana lukuli lwawo na iwanyama wana lukuli lwawo, wapfideghe wana lukuli lwawo na iwasomba wana lukuli lwawo.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kuya kuna ng'uli tsa kulanga na tsa muisi, ukunogha kwe ng'uli tsa kulanga ng'akwighala ne ukunogha kwe ng'uli tsa muisi. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Litsua lina ukunogha kwake na lwetsi luna ukunogha kwake na tsinondo tsina ukunogha kwake, na hata tsinondo natso ng'atsighala bae mna ukunogha.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Apfi pfipfo pfaitsakuwa hawatsotsilihuka iwanu. Ka pfaili imbeghu, lukuli lotsikighwa aku lwola, lekeni lwotsilihuka aku lughima. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Lwotsikighwa mna chinyala, lotsilihuka mna utunitso, lwotsikighwa aku lwahela ngupfu lwotsilihuka aku luna ngupfu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Haulutsikighwa, lwotsikighwa lukuli lwa chimunu, kuya lwotsilihuka lukuli lwe chimuhe. Ka hana lukuli lwa chimunu, pfipfila hana lukuli lwa chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Mana Ghamaandiko gholonga, “Imunu we mwanduso, Adamu, tsakawa imunu mghima,” lekeni Adamu wa usighilo iyo Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iyoweng'a iwanu ughima. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Si lukuli lwa ghumuhe bae iulongola, ila lukuli lwa chimunu, kuya lukuli lwa chimuhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Adamu wa mwanduso tsakalawa mne timbwisi lye isi, Adamu wa keli tsakalawa kulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Awala we iisi weghala na ayula iyalawile muisi, na awala we kulanga weghala na ayula iyalawile kulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ka pfatwighalile na ayula yalumbighwe na lidongo, pfipfila twitseghala na ayula yalawile kulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Ndughu tsangu chonilonga hano chicho chino, lukuli lwe imunu ng'aludaha bae kuhala Undewa we Imulungu, wala aghala ighohinyika ng'aghodaha bae kuleka ukuhinyika.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Tegheletseni, nowalongelelani mbuli; wose ng'atutsokufa bae, ila wose tutsoghaluka, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />malati haitsolila, baho, iwanu iwafile watsotsilihulighwa aku ng'uli tsawo ng'atsolile bae, kuya na twetwe ng'atutsakufa ila tutsoghaluka. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Mana aghala ighohinyika ghobamighwa ghaghaluke ghawe ing'aghohinyika bae, lukuli ulukufa lughaluke luleke kufa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Apfo lukuli luno iluhinyika halutsoghaluka luleke kuhinyika, na achila ichikufa hachitsoghaluka chileke kufa, baho ghatsotimila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka igholonga, “Lifwa likomighwa, ukuhuma kutimila!”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />Ghwe lifwa kulikwani ukuhuma kwako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Ghwe lifwa ulikwani usungu wako?<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Lifwa lyopata ngupfu yo ukulagha kulawa mnzambi, na nzambi yopata ngupfu mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Lekeni mighede kwe Imulungu iyotutenda tuhume kubitila Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Apfo ndughu tsangu mwime ghoya, mleke kuhighisika. Matsuwa ghose mghendelele ghendo kusang'ana ing'onde ye Imtwatsa, kwaapfila mmanye isang'ano yamsang'ana mghati mwa Imtwatsa ng'aikwagha hela bae.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Msango kwe iwanu we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Lelo nonge imbuli yokuwasangila iwanu we Imulungu, mtende achila chanighalongele makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu gha Wagalatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Chila jumapili, chila munu mghati mwenu yabaghule sendi iilawa mna achila choyobokela, kuya yeke ili hanikutsa ndeke kubama msango keli. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Kuya hanipfika kuna mwemwe nitsowatuma awala yamuwasaghula waghale ibaluwa na msango wenu Yerusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Ka pfinogha na nene kughenda ako, watselongotsa na nene.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Hanitsobita kughenda Makedoniya, tanu nitsakutsa kuna mwemwe, mana nobama kughenda Makedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Nodaha kukala na mwemwe chidogho, au kukala namwe matsuwa ghose gha chipfeghetsi, ili mnyapfile mna ghumwanza wangu kokose konighenda. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Sibama bae kwibona na mwemwe kwa kubita kuliheka, nobama nikale namwe chidogho Imtwatsa ang'abama.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Lekeni nitsokala hano Efeso mbaka litsuwa lya Pentekoste, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />kwaapfila libani lya mwatsi kwa sang'ano yangu ng'ulu hano, hata ka kuna iwanu wengi iwobela ghanilonga.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Timoteo ang'atsa mumtende aleke kwalangula chinu chochose hayatsokala na mwemwe, kwaapfila yeye kosang'ana ing'onde ye Imtwatsa ka nene. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Apfo imunu wowose yaleke kumbetsa, ila mwapfileni yaghendelele tseghamba na ghumwanza wake ili yadahe kumbuyila. Mana nomlolela yoye ne iwanu wangi.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Lelo nonge mbuli ya ndughu yetu Apolo, tsanimkomangitsa yamwangileni hamwe na iwandughu wangi. Lekeni ng'obama bae kutsa sambi, lekeni katsakutsa hayatsopata uleghelo.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Mkale meso, mwikindilise mne ukutoghola, mwime chilume na muwe iwanu wane ngupfu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Msang'ane ghose kwa kwinoghela.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Mwommanya Stefana na iwanu wa mkaye mwake, wawo tsawalongola kuwa wakiristu ako Akaya, kuya tsawelapfa wenyegho kuwasang'anila iwanu we Imulungu. Apfo ndughu tsangu nowalomba, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />muwategheletse iwanu ka awo na chila imunu iyosang'ana nawo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Tsandeng'ela hawatsile Stefana na Fotonata na Akaiko, kwaapfila tsawamemesa achila ichihunguke kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Mana tsawadeng'eletsa ghumoyo ghwangu ka pfawamdeng'eletseni mwemwe. Iwanu awo pfinogha wang'akumbukighwa.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu gha Asiya ghomlamsani. Akila na Pilisila ne iwanu wose iwotingana mkaye mwawo womlamsani kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Wandughu wose iwali hano womlamsani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Mwilamse kwa kulangusa unoghelo wa Kiristu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nene, Pauli nowalamsani, nakwandika kwa ghumoko ghwangu mwenyegho.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Imunu wowose iyolema kumnoghela Imtwatsa, ayo yalighitwe. Utse ghwe Imtwatsa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Uluso we Imtwatsa Yesu ukale namwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Unoghelo wangu ukale na mwemwe wose yamli mghati mwa Kiristu Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>